Trim share, open-with, browser, and text-processing candidate lists with priority ordering, swipe-right lock / swipe-left unlock, aggregated Locked views, and user/system app filtering. Component management prefers Android subsystem registries with compatibility fallbacks and fail-open behavior, using real Root disable plus LSPosed discovery filtering and automatic boot reconciliation for tiles, shortcut creation entries, and home-screen widgets. Requires modern libxposed API 102 and Android 12 or newer.
